{"3929610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "數論冒險譚 - 魔王與秘林迷路", "steam_appid": 3929610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/4ca444b3cf394f280052b17385f1a412.avif?t=1758267880\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras_big/4ca444b3cf394f280052b17385f1a412.webp?t=1758267880 width=1560 height=435 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >當勇者與魔王成為異世界搭檔？一場為了回家而展開的生存冒險！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★劇情簡介★</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >╞════════════════════════════╡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一名生來就注定成為「魔王」，卻只渴望平凡生活的少女露莉莉；一名相信「所有麻煩都能用高等物理搞定」，天真爛漫的勇者拉絲莉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在一次意外中，本應是宿敵的兩人，連同追尋世界真理的科學家曼絲麗朵，一同被捲入了神秘的異次元之中。被封印在無盡的森林迷宮，她們唯一的目標，就是找到回家的路。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在這個陌生的世界裡，昨日的敵人成為今日的戰友。為了生存，她們必須攜手合作，探索未知，打造道具，並在一次次的戰鬥中加深羈絆。一場充滿歡笑、淚水與奇妙化學反應的異世界求生之旅，就此展開！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/e47e467028b12da7026072f770880340.poster.avif?t=1758267880\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/e47e467028b12da7026072f770880340.webm?t=1758267880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/e47e467028b12da7026072f770880340.mp4?t=1758267880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★遊戲玩法★</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >╞════════════════════════════╡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >獨具魅力的主角</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >從戰鬥風格截然不同的少女中選擇一位進行操作。無論你升級了誰，等級都將共通，讓你隨時可以切換心愛的角色上場，體驗不同的戰鬥樂趣，無須重複練功！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/e5c9bf089c856f674aa0a150cf87662e.avif?t=1758267880\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras_big/e5c9bf089c856f674aa0a150cf87662e.avif?t=1758267880 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >創造屬於你的流派與構築：「武器鑲嵌系統」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作的核心所在！為你的技能裝備鑲上各種「效果器」，就能徹底改變其特性！火焰魔法可以變成追蹤彈，普通斬擊也能附加冰凍或吸血效果。組合千變萬化，鑽研出只屬於你的最強戰鬥流派！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/a8784eb89e6fb10efa0173bb7c545a31.avif?t=1758267880\" width=1024 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >無盡的隨機生成迷宮</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一次的探索都充滿未知！你將在隨機生成的 3D 迷宮中冒險。擊敗敵人，搜集素材，深入那潛藏著無數驚喜與危險的森林。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/fd78364ffb40cb0c200f9427f7cf0800.avif?t=1758267880\" width=1024 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >異世界的生存智慧</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >冒險的根本是活下去！將打倒的魔物掉落物丟進「闇鍋」烹煮，恢復體力；或是作為材料，打造出強大的裝備與實用道具。善用每一份資源，是生存的唯一法則。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >輕鬆上手，深度十足</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >操作流暢，讓熟悉地城冒險 RPG 的玩家能立刻融入。系統深度十足，無論是輕度玩家享受劇情，還是硬核玩家追求極致的技能搭配與迷宮挑戰，都能在其中找到無窮樂趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★人物簡介★</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >╞════════════════════════════╡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >露莉莉  - 象徵破壞的魔王</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「困擾我一生的『魔王』這個稱號的意義...到底是什麼？」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/0e619ca0dd07dd1fe1850db101c329a7.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拉絲莉- 探求力量的勇者</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「不管遇到什麼麻煩，用高等物理打破就對了！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/882a30157de0629172ec88d649a5c69e.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >曼絲麗朵- 真理頌願者</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「果然這個世界還是有很多有趣的事呢。」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/f210d2e83feacd3a3eb645ec729f0cdb.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >曼絲麗葉- 追隨勇者的機娘</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「我的身體與精神都奉獻給主人！我的生命是靠拉絲莉主人的努力才得到的。」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >月雯- 召喚師之卵</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「在成為世界第一的召喚師之前，我絕對不會輸的！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/1520f24cfa510e3bdc4258ffbb651330.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔獸- 月雯的召喚獸</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「月雯會變成這樣是我的罪，能讓主人幸福才是我的目標。」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/b6486464aa8a7cad902d84e44f961fec.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >時空旅人- ?????</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「不要妨礙我！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/f3b3a875ba23ae8fb45716eaa63e42ef.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >白玉- 白色死神</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「妳是光之聖女嗎？不是的話就讓開！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/4978539cb279d9f58153b45765e20619.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/4ca444b3cf394f280052b17385f1a412.avif?t=1758267880\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras_big/4ca444b3cf394f280052b17385f1a412.webp?t=1758267880 width=1560 height=435 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >當勇者與魔王成為異世界搭檔？一場為了回家而展開的生存冒險！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★劇情簡介★</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >╞════════════════════════════╡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一名生來就注定成為「魔王」，卻只渴望平凡生活的少女露莉莉；一名相信「所有麻煩都能用高等物理搞定」，天真爛漫的勇者拉絲莉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在一次意外中，本應是宿敵的兩人，連同追尋世界真理的科學家曼絲麗朵，一同被捲入了神秘的異次元之中。被封印在無盡的森林迷宮，她們唯一的目標，就是找到回家的路。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在這個陌生的世界裡，昨日的敵人成為今日的戰友。為了生存，她們必須攜手合作，探索未知，打造道具，並在一次次的戰鬥中加深羈絆。一場充滿歡笑、淚水與奇妙化學反應的異世界求生之旅，就此展開！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/e47e467028b12da7026072f770880340.poster.avif?t=1758267880\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/e47e467028b12da7026072f770880340.webm?t=1758267880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/e47e467028b12da7026072f770880340.mp4?t=1758267880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa