><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「困擾我一生的『魔王』這個稱號的意義...到底是什麼？」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/0e619ca0dd07dd1fe1850db101c329a7.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拉絲莉- 探求力量的勇者</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「不管遇到什麼麻煩，用高等物理打破就對了！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/882a30157de0629172ec88d649a5c69e.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >曼絲麗朵- 真理頌願者</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「果然這個世界還是有很多有趣的事呢。」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/f210d2e83feacd3a3eb645ec729f0cdb.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >曼絲麗葉- 追隨勇者的機娘</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「我的身體與精神都奉獻給主人！我的生命是靠拉絲莉主人的努力才得到的。」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >月雯- 召喚師之卵</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「在成為世界第一的召喚師之前，我絕對不會輸的！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/1520f24cfa510e3bdc4258ffbb651330.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔獸- 月雯的召喚獸</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「月雯會變成這樣是我的罪，能讓主人幸福才是我的目標。」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/b6486464aa8a7cad902d84e44f961fec.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >時空旅人- ?????</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「不要妨礙我！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/f3b3a875ba23ae8fb45716eaa63e42ef.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >白玉- 白色死神</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「妳是光之聖女嗎？不是的話就讓開！」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/extras/4978539cb279d9f58153b45765e20619.avif?t=1758267880\" width=802 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "歡迎來到這款輕鬆歡樂的3D迷宮ARPG遊戲！一場顛覆常理的意外，將只想過平凡生活的魔王、與信奉「物理萬能」的天真勇者，一同捲入了神秘的異次元。 為了找到回家的路，這對奇妙的組合必須攜手合作，在這片無盡延伸、每次進入都會隨機變化的森林迷宮中展開求生冒險。", "supported_languages": "Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/a0ba16c06880b2cd9c8cc903c4a152348f17da53/header.jpg?t=1758267880", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/1d8be468af7b3ed02a9b1edcca3c893647c76ff4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758267880", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929610/1d8be468af7b3ed02a9b1edcca3c893647c76ff4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758267880", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> geforce6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> geforce6600<br></li><li><strong>Di